  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Optimized Document Management with Camunda and Alfresco",
    "splashDescription": "\"Every process contains a document\" is a common saying, and it is actually almost true. Alfresco Content Services is a enterprise content management system that can manage all types of documents. This Connector enables you to manage documents in Alfresco with processes that are orchestrated by Camunda.",
